 {"id": "PEDS-C27-091", "sec": "Asthma probability", "page": 122, "q": "Which criteria indicate ↑ probability for future asthma (requires treatment) in a preschool child?", "opts": ["Symptoms lasting > 3 d after URI and 1 episode", "Symptoms only with exercise", "Symptoms relieved by antibiotics", "Symptoms lasting > 10 d after URI AND > 3 episodes"], "ans": 3, "exp": "↑ probability for future asthma (requires treatment): symptoms last > 10 d after URI AND > 3 episodes (Book p122)", "type": "mcq"},
